[{:db/id 17592186162020 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3fa88aaf-70b9-5b39-b375-a1ff9fc14a4f" "question-c83e57db-b20b-5f69-af71-6e6e6a8e413f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161812 :question/problem "Given that $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 21 \\right\\rbrace,$ compute $P(X = 18).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n![](images/bd/bdbe38e4c652e888c4eea890738bccb4d70804cd2b7c23058f72dd2c8996d717.svg)\n\nHere, we have $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 21 \\right\\rbrace,$ and the set $S = \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 21 \\right\\rbrace$ has $|S|=21 - 7 + 1 = 15$ items. So, we have\n\n![](images/47/4757730008d9d00bdd406065d1aaad881d6b2a95bb65dc9a021982b00cbd9059.svg)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nP(X = 18) = f(18) = \\dfrac{1}{15}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162036 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-49e5ad2d-03f1-55be-ada8-dbc0284264c6" "question-0437d140-6528-59da-a359-aaf4bce3a4ae"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161829 :question/problem "Given $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 5, 6, 7, \\ldots, 14 \\right\\rbrace,$ compute $P(X \\geq 9).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n![](images/a3/a35341e15b714d4d0682b7a254e26cc141f0d4a0f5a5c4b951f91e7da095512d.svg)\n\nHere, we have $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 5, 6, 7, \\ldots, 14 \\right\\rbrace,$ and the set $S = \\left\\lbrace 5, 6, 7, \\ldots, 14 \\right\\rbrace$ has $|S|=14 - 5 + 1 = 10$ items. So, we have\n\n![](images/52/526312cdbaa5f0462aafcea89d4719a4a2f058445f367d720b852dbad0048aaa.svg)\n\nIn $S,$ the items that satisfy $X \\geq 9$ are $9, 10, 11, \\ldots , 14.$ There are $14 - 9 + 1 = 6$ of these items. Therefore,\n\n$$\nP(X \\geq 9) = 6 \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{10} = \\dfrac{3}{5}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162021 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-b4439689-3a8b-5ab4-811b-957340569ef9" "question-a7e41369-c44a-5b84-b7fc-e764205aba15"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186161813 :question/problem "Given $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 16\\right\\rbrace,$ compute $P(8 \\leq          X < 13).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n![](images/cf/cf4a1e915e224fdbbbe53116e848c661f93acad19f5637ec09b704a949a4dd05.svg)\n\nHere, we have $X \\sim U \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 16 \\right\\rbrace,$ and the set $S = \\left\\lbrace 7, 8, 9, \\ldots, 16 \\right\\rbrace$ has $|S|=16 - 7 + 1 = 10$ items. So, we have\n\n![](images/04/048e928b8243c02a895c03b17473898770d6e2738b21bb61a92d86a6e3d52bfc.svg)\n\nIn $S,$ there are $5$ items $(8, 9, 10, 11, 12)$ that satisfy $8 \\leq  X < 13.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nP(8 \\leq  X < 13) = 5 \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{10} = \\dfrac{1}{2}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-3fa88aaf-70b9-5b39-b375-a1ff9fc14a4f" :question/id #uuid "3fa88aaf-70b9-5b39-b375-a1ff9fc14a4f" :question/math-academy-id "q-96778" :question/problem "Given that $X∼U\\{3,7,9,10\\},$ compute $P(X=9).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{|S|}, & x\\in S \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we have $X∼U\\{3,7,9,10\\},$ and the set $S=\\{3,7,9,10\\}$ has $|S|=4$ items. So, we have\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4}, & x=3,7,9,10 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nP(X=9)=f(9)=\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-17dd14c1-f0a6-5f73-9ff5-1250112c1e2d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-17dd14c1-f0a6-5f73-9ff5-1250112c1e2d" :answer-field/id #uuid "17dd14c1-f0a6-5f73-9ff5-1250112c1e2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9a3ca409-a4c3-54ba-b34a-0eaab0215bcf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d00c4e38-efbb-57f3-bf1e-8cd2dd37778d" "answer-65710dca-584a-5538-8392-0c75db50947c" "answer-9a3ca409-a4c3-54ba-b34a-0eaab0215bcf" "answer-42bd1876-65cb-5fd8-a63d-6a5b4ed622b4" "answer-647f830c-4930-5419-a92d-35fb9d117c48"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d00c4e38-efbb-57f3-bf1e-8cd2dd37778d" :answer/id #uuid "d00c4e38-efbb-57f3-bf1e-8cd2dd37778d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65710dca-584a-5538-8392-0c75db50947c" :answer/id #uuid "65710dca-584a-5538-8392-0c75db50947c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9a3ca409-a4c3-54ba-b34a-0eaab0215bcf" :answer/id #uuid "9a3ca409-a4c3-54ba-b34a-0eaab0215bcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-42bd1876-65cb-5fd8-a63d-6a5b4ed622b4" :answer/id #uuid "42bd1876-65cb-5fd8-a63d-6a5b4ed622b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-647f830c-4930-5419-a92d-35fb9d117c48" :answer/id #uuid "647f830c-4930-5419-a92d-35fb9d117c48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-c83e57db-b20b-5f69-af71-6e6e6a8e413f" :question/id #uuid "c83e57db-b20b-5f69-af71-6e6e6a8e413f" :question/math-academy-id "q-96780" :question/problem "Given that $X∼U\\{13,14,18\\},$ compute $P(X=14).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{|S|}, & x\\in S \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we have $X∼U\\{13,14,18\\},$ and the set $S=\\{13,14,18\\}$ has $|S|=3$ items. So, we have\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}, & x=13,14,18 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nP(X=14)=f(14)=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f32b7f4b-707c-5946-80d1-f757bb8e4cf5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f32b7f4b-707c-5946-80d1-f757bb8e4cf5" :answer-field/id #uuid "f32b7f4b-707c-5946-80d1-f757bb8e4cf5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6a09e155-68e9-5775-88e9-0c0dd6011287" :answer-field/choices ["answer-be11ebe4-c5f0-5452-93cf-c1171aabffec" "answer-e1a79c61-b7dd-5a80-b81d-55f14b24abc5" "answer-6a09e155-68e9-5775-88e9-0c0dd6011287" "answer-d0318c22-f087-5f8c-bdd5-bca3ec896998" "answer-af474fa2-5b82-5e5b-919d-49bf9a3d89c0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be11ebe4-c5f0-5452-93cf-c1171aabffec" :answer/id #uuid "be11ebe4-c5f0-5452-93cf-c1171aabffec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1a79c61-b7dd-5a80-b81d-55f14b24abc5" :answer/id #uuid "e1a79c61-b7dd-5a80-b81d-55f14b24abc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6a09e155-68e9-5775-88e9-0c0dd6011287" :answer/id #uuid "6a09e155-68e9-5775-88e9-0c0dd6011287" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d0318c22-f087-5f8c-bdd5-bca3ec896998" :answer/id #uuid "d0318c22-f087-5f8c-bdd5-bca3ec896998" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-af474fa2-5b82-5e5b-919d-49bf9a3d89c0" :answer/id #uuid "af474fa2-5b82-5e5b-919d-49bf9a3d89c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-49e5ad2d-03f1-55be-ada8-dbc0284264c6" :question/id #uuid "49e5ad2d-03f1-55be-ada8-dbc0284264c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-96810" :question/problem "Given $X∼U\\{9,10,11,…,17\\},$ compute $P(X<12).$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ follows a discrete uniform distribution over a set $S,$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{|S|}, & x\\in S \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we have $X∼U\\{9,10,11,…,17\\},$ and the set $S=\\{9,10,11,…,17\\}$ has $|S|=17-9+1=9$ items. So, we have\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9}, & x=9,10,11,…,17 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn $S,$ the items that satisfy $X<12$ are $9,10,11.$ There are $3$ of these items. Therefore,\n\n$$\nP(X<12)=3\\cdot \\frac{1}{9}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ac586fbc-baee-5b6b-94a9-3c6e6210f9e1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ac586fbc-baee-5b6b-94a9-3c6e6210f9e1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ac586fbc-baee-5b6b-94a9-3c6e6210f9e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-867fb739-bcef-5db1-ad21-be3d3d6e70e2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-867fb739-bcef-5db1-ad21-be3d3d6e70e2" "answer-26cab201-dd5a-5522-a7c5-25241811d134" "answer-e4aa368d-d1cf-529c-b6c7-9e7448c03be7" "answer-771bbc36-1481-5967-acf3-99e3381b2049" "answer-5b6c4c06-c4a6-59a0-90bc-5dba036d765a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-867fb739-bcef-5db1-ad21-be3d3d6e70e2" :answer/id #uuid "867fb739-bcef-5db1-ad21-be3d3d6e70e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-26cab201-dd5a-5522-a7c5-25241811d134" :answer/id #uuid "26cab201-dd5a-5522-a7c5-25241811d134" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e4aa368d-d1cf-529c-b6c7-9e7448c03be7" :answer/id #uuid "e4aa368d-d